      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I definitely agree with this. However, in its execution, it needs to be so that a new user isn't able to accidentally \"mess up\" the categories by, for example, deleting some important categories. Also, obviously, other users can't be able to affect someone's menu, that would open another can of worms in terms of griefing.",
