  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-04-08T00:00:29.176Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It would be nice not having to constantly dig to the bottom of the world list to find my own worlds. \nAnd likewise, I'd imagine people would like to reorganize the world categories in general. \nMaybe someone wants to put labs at top, or maybe even have recent be the first one.\nI'd probably put games and my own worlds at the top personally.",
